                    "Text": "# Total entries: 25\n\n- 20261006.log Oct 06 08:30 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\20261006.log\nd lessons Oct 06 08:13 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\lessons\n- lesson5b.exe Oct 06 08:13 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\lessons\\lesson5b.exe\n- lesson5b_decay_matters.c Oct 06 08:13 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\lessons\\lesson5b_decay_matters.c\n- capstone_scores.exe Oct 06 07:41 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\lessons\\capstone_scores.exe\n- capstone_scores.c Oct 06 07:40 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\lessons\\capstone_scores.c\n- lesson5.exe Oct 06 07:29 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\lessons\\lesson5.exe\n- lesson5_arrays_are_pointers.c Oct 06 07:29 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\lessons\\lesson5_arrays_are_pointers.c\n- lesson4.exe Oct 06 07:21 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\lessons\\lesson4.exe\n- lesson4_swap.c Oct 06 07:19 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\lessons\\lesson4_swap.c\n- lesson3.exe Oct 06 07:14 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\lessons\\lesson3.exe\n- lesson3_why_functions_need_pointers.c Oct 06 07:13 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\lessons\\lesson3_why_functions_need_pointers.c\n- lesson2.exe Oct 06 03:29 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\lessons\\lesson2.exe\n- lesson2_two_labels_one_box.c Oct 06 03:29 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\lessons\\lesson2_two_labels_one_box.c\n- lesson1.exe Oct 06 03:23 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\lessons\\lesson1.exe\n- lesson1_box_and_label.c Oct 06 03:22 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\lessons\\lesson1_box_and_label.c\n- passingPointersAsArguments.exe Oct 06 02:54 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\pointer\\passingPointersAsArguments.exe\nd pointer Oct 06 02:54 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\pointer\n- passingPointersAsArguments.c Oct 06 02:53 C:\\Use