                    "Text": "# Total entries: 16\n\n- .gitignore Oct 07 05:20 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\.gitignore\nd 01-pointers Oct 07 05:20 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\01-pointers\nd app Oct 07 05:20 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\app\n- 20261006.log Oct 06 08:30 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\20261006.log\n- 09_array_decays.c Oct 06 08:13 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\01-pointers\\09_array_decays.c\n- capstone_scores.c Oct 06 07:40 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\app\\capstone_scores.c\n- 08_arrays_are_pointers.c Oct 06 07:29 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\01-pointers\\08_arrays_are_pointers.c\n- 05_swap.c Oct 06 07:19 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\01-pointers\\05_swap.c\n- 07_functions_and_pointers.c Oct 06 07:13 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\01-pointers\\07_functions_and_pointers.c\n- 04_two_labels_one_box.c Oct 06 03:29 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\01-pointers\\04_two_labels_one_box.c\n- 06_box_and_labels.c Oct 06 03:22 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\01-pointers\\06_box_and_labels.c\n- 03_passing_pointers_as_function_args.c Oct 06 02:53 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\01-pointers\\03_passing_pointers_as_function_args.c\n- 01_deref.c Oct 06 02:50 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\01-pointers\\01_deref.c\nd .vscode Oct 06 02:46 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\.vscode\n- tasks.json Oct 06 02:46 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\.vscode\\tasks.json\n- 01_address.c Oct 06 02:45 C:\\Users\\ngandhi\\github\\beej-guide-to-c\\01-pointers\\01_address.c"
